  "description": "Provider-neutral contracts and shared models for Mythosia.AI. Defines IAIService and the optional IAIRunService, IAIRequestFeatureService, and IImageGenerationService capabilities; controllable run handles; common reasoning and hosted-search options; citations; messages and streaming content; GPT-6 model configuration; image request/results; and ordered function batches with opt-in asynchronous-call metadata. Existing IAIService implementations gain no required members. Depends only on the lightweight Mythosia base package and no provider SDKs.",
